  "description": "The official MAUI wrapper for the Brady SDK allows the connection between a mobile device and a Brady printer to allow the printing of labels.\n\t\t\tAllows development in C# with .NET 8 MAUI to integrate both the iOS and Android functionalities supported by the Brady SDK's.",
